# text = As , regards my share in the recommendation which we found ourselves bound to submit to the Treasury , I must say that I never felt less hesitation in my life , and I believe I may declare as much as regards the other members of the Board Indeed you may , as far as I am concerned I told the Chancellor of the Exchequer that unless he had some first-rate man to send from elsewhere I could name a fitting candidate . ' Sir Raffle ,' he said , ' I mean to keep it in the office , and therefore shall be glad of your opinion .' '
